  "boundaries": [
    "Already issued requests cannot be recalled; validation happens before later dispatches and does not freeze source availability afterward.",
    "Context compilation may persist a manifest even if a later cancellation, deadline or lease check blocks dispatch; exposure remains conservative.",
    "Historical dependencies include rejected attempts and Skill phases; no per-sentence provenance inference.",
    "Required sources remain a workflow binding; normal conversation knowledge remains optional.",
    "Frozen Skill instructions/resources and task inputs remain unchanged; native capabilities are not expanded.",
    "Standalone planners without the Runtime hook retain caller-supplied context behavior.",
    "Schema retry limits and transport-error failure semantics remain unchanged; no automatic network/auth/timeout retry added.",
    "Synthetic model transports verify actual inputs, audit and UI behavior, not real model comprehension; no production data or publication."
  ]
